flowchart LR
  accTitle: A bounded stream-reading loop
  accDescr: Reuse a fixed-size buffer for arbitrarily chunked input. Process only the returned byte count, keep parser state, and repeat until EOF without accumulating the entire stream.
  Input["File or pipe: arbitrary chunks"] --> Read["Read into fixed-size buffer"] --> Process["Process data up to returned n; keep parser state"]
  Process -->|"next chunk"| Read
  Read -->|"EOF"| Done["Finish parser; release resources"]
